
NTeX Release 1.2 --- ntb-texi 1.1 --- status: optional

This package contains the binaries for the texinfo system and the .info
files for texinfo. Texinfo is a system that allows you to create .info and
.tex files from one .texi file. The info files are online documents that
can be viewed with the command info. You can produce a printed version of
the documentation form the TeX files.

